# Testing Rule

**When adding or modifying functions, always create or update the corresponding test.**

## Backend
- Add unit/integration tests in `backend/src/tests/` or `backend/src/__tests__/`
- Test service methods, controllers, and routes
- Use Vitest and real DB for integration tests (see `activity.test.ts`)

## Frontend
- Add component tests in `__tests__` folders next to the component (e.g. `components/__tests__/Foo.test.tsx`)
- Add service tests in `services/__tests__/` or `test/`
- Use Vitest, @testing-library/react, and testUtils for rendering with providers

## Checklist for new functions
1. [ ] Create or update the paired test file
2. [ ] Cover happy path and error cases
3. [ ] Mock external dependencies (API, auth) in frontend tests
4. [ ] Run `npm run test` in both frontend and backend before committing
